---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import { url } from "../../lib/url";
---
<Base
  title={'Cancellations & paused memberships — Blueprint Fitness'}
  description={'Change, pause or cancel your Blueprint Fitness membership.'}
  noindex>


  <section class="section on-dark section-tight">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="dim sec-head" style="margin-bottom:1rem">Cancellations &amp; paused memberships</p>
      <h1 class="h-display">Let us know you need to <span class="draft-u">make changes</span></h1>
      <p class="lede">Life changes &mdash; memberships can too. Here&rsquo;s how changes,
        pauses and cancellations work, and exactly what to do for each.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <p class="dim">Changes &amp; pauses</p>
        <h2 class="h-1">Need to adjust, not cancel?</h2>
        <p class="lede">Most changes just need an email before your next billing cycle date so
          there&rsquo;s time to process them.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-3 stagger">
        <article class="card">
          <p class="annotation" style="margin:0 0 .3rem">Moving up or down</p>
          <h3 class="h-3">Change your subscription</h3>
          <p>We can change your membership subscription at any time. We&rsquo;ll need to be
            notified in writing before your next billing cycle date in order for it to be
            processed in sufficient time.</p>
          <p class="card-cta"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="mailto:info@blueprintfitnessldn.com?subject=Membership%20change%20request">Email us to request a change</a></p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <p class="annotation" style="margin:0 0 .3rem">Taking a breather</p>
          <h3 class="h-3">Pause your membership</h3>
          <p>We&rsquo;re able to pause for one month at a time. After the paused month, your
            membership reinstates and the monthly fee is taken as normal.</p>
          <p class="card-cta"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="mailto:info@blueprintfitnessldn.com?subject=Membership%20pause%20request">Email us to request a pause</a></p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <p class="annotation" style="margin:0 0 .3rem">Off on holiday?</p>
          <h3 class="h-3">Holiday adjustments</h3>
          <p>We can&rsquo;t pause for two weeks within a billing cycle &mdash; instead, reduce
            your subscription to suit the sessions you need that month (for example, drop from
            SGPT&nbsp;12 to SGPT&nbsp;8), then move back when you return.</p>
          <p class="card-cta"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="mailto:info@blueprintfitnessldn.com?subject=Holiday%20membership%20adjustment">Email us about a holiday</a></p>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="callout" style="max-width:46rem;margin-top:2rem">
        <p>For any membership change, we need to be notified <strong>before your next billing
          cycle date</strong> in order for it to be processed in sufficient time.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="cancel-nudge"><a href="#cancel-forms" data-scroll-to>Sure you want to cancel? Tap here &darr;</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section on-dark" id="cancel-forms">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:44rem;text-align:center">
      <p class="annotation reveal">We&rsquo;d be sorry to see you go</p>
      <h2 class="h-1">Cancelling your <span class="draft-u">membership</span></h2>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-inline:auto">There is a 30-day notice period for all
        membership cancellations. Fill out the form for your studio and we&rsquo;ll contact you
        in due course. Thank you!</p>
      <p class="dim" style="margin:2rem 0 1rem;justify-content:center">Choose your studio</p>
      <div class="studio-choice" style="margin-inline:auto">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://link.stronger.systems/widget/form/sGRVF4TDOJuG1B55SN95" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-embed-form="sGRVF4TDOJuG1B55SN95" data-embed-height="661" data-studio="South Woodford">South Woodford</a>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://link.stronger.systems/widget/form/CRXo5oPCz8vG0Wf1qKrD" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-embed-form="CRXo5oPCz8vG0Wf1qKrD" data-embed-height="600" data-studio="Leytonstone">Leytonstone</a>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://link.stronger.systems/widget/form/zqqA4jVAOEMR7yq3UhEt" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-embed-form="zqqA4jVAOEMR7yq3UhEt" data-embed-height="640" data-studio="Hackney">Hackney</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hold-hint" style="margin-top:1.4rem">Opens your studio&rsquo;s cancellation form</p>
      <p class="small" style="margin-top:1.2rem"><a href={url("members/bookings-cancellations/")} style="color:#5EA2FF">Just need to cancel a session, not your membership? That&rsquo;s over here &rarr;</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>


</Base>
